{186}{}{Recognizing the value of a friendly gesture, I extended a helping hand to Beatrice. While she initially expressed interest in becoming my personal bodyguard - though the term seemed unfamiliar to her - I offered her a different role. Thus, Beatrice became the bouncer for my new "saloon", Dusty's Desires. She embraced her new position with enthusiasm, and ever since, she has faithfully watched over our clients. She's perfect for bouncer duties.}
